{"name": "Starlit World", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"266\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/ede242e81da75c7a170af0eaad404aa1.poster.avif?t=1786367302\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/ede242e81da75c7a170af0eaad404aa1.webm?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/ede242e81da75c7a170af0eaad404aa1.mp4?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Explore Enchanting Worlds</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through unique landscapes and charming places, each with its own obstacles and challenges. Find hidden paths and discover something new in every world.<br/> <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"266\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/92f08b3f4d20269d6742d0b0ed0a7626.poster.avif?t=1786367302\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/92f08b3f4d20269d6742d0b0ed0a7626.webm?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/92f08b3f4d20269d6742d0b0ed0a7626.mp4?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><strong><u> </u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Rescue the Starlits</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore during the day and survive the night. Run, jump, and fight enemies as you collect gems and grow stronger. Find the scattered Starlits and bring them safely back home.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"266\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/b382fa70d704fb8c1b728cc6e18fe799.poster.avif?t=1786367302\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/b382fa70d704fb8c1b728cc6e18fe799.webm?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/b382fa70d704fb8c1b728cc6e18fe799.mp4?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Fight Mighty Bosses</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face a powerful boss at the end of each world. Learn their attacks, dodge at the right time, and break Oli\u2019s spell to set them free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"266\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/770c59d9ac5f6db8cd4f94958ea8794e.poster.avif?t=1786367302\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/770c59d9ac5f6db8cd4f94958ea8794e.webm?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/770c59d9ac5f6db8cd4f94958ea8794e.mp4?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Discover Special Suits</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each suit offers unique powers and a different playstyle. Choose the one that best fits your style to explore, fight enemies, and overcome challenges your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"266\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/053b98a85a66f97a8097d6ef2e5dbd7f.poster.avif?t=1786367302\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/053b98a85a66f97a8097d6ef2e5dbd7f.webm?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/053b98a85a66f97a8097d6ef2e5dbd7f.mp4?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Rebuild Starlit Island</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bring Starlit Island back to life with every Starlit you rescue. Explore new areas, meet its residents, and watch the island grow. Collect stickers, complete your album, and unlock rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"266\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/24683a9b59c452dfc14cc3d190303ce0.poster.avif?t=1786367302\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/24683a9b59c452dfc14cc3d190303ce0.webm?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/24683a9b59c452dfc14cc3d190303ce0.mp4?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Help Bo & Kiki save the Starlits from Oli\u2019s evil spell in a cute and chaotic 3D platforming adventure! Discover special suits, fight bosses, and explore magical worlds as you rebuild Starlit Island and complete your sticker album!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/294d76521e07ebca3d5249abdc7d4ffc18ff91f8/header.jpg?t=1786367302", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["3D Platformer", "Collectathon", "Cute", "Action-Adventure", "Arcade", "Family Friendly"], "developers": "Rockhead Studios", "publishers": "Rockhead Studios", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "1356660", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "9 July 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/MNtvNFS4trc", "first_seen": 1783555200.0, "review_rank": 296}